// Exact expressions and contextual actions shared by mathematical owners:
// each admitted operation's category and contexts. This is not a dialect-wide
// grant. Interfaces supply dependencies only after an exact registered
// operation has matched this list. Admitted attributes are the operation's
// decided semantic fields, so they are not restated here.
